  * jira_get_sprint_issues
  * jira_create_issue
  * jira_update_issue
  * jira_assign_issue
  * jira_add_comment
  * jira_create_sprint
  * jira_move_issue_to_sprint
- Uses requests + Jira REST API
"]

end

